    <statement><p>Let <m>A = {\left\{1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8\right\}}\text{.}</m> How many injective functions <m>f:A \to A</m> have the property that for each <m>x \in A\text{,}</m> <m>f(x) \ne x\text{?}</m></p>
<p><fillin characters="15" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>8!-25487</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>14833 functions. This is a sneaky way to ask for the number of derangements on 8 elements.</p>
</solution>
